### Create activity class (run Authenticate in auth.http first)
POST {{base_url}}/activity-classes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "sportId": "15e8ef23-350a-47e2-9e60-052cf6fe48da",
  "roomId": "7ec5a107-ea02-4773-a179-8e2e6ecd7bbe",
